                                        "sense_id": "7093f3e0-a1aa-3437-889b-d4279c591147",
                                        "entry_id": "44764fec-f152-398c-9ee7-9bc6e276402d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ailment caused by a deficiency of thiamine (vitamin B1), leading to lethargy and organ complications."
